==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:Horrible Hiccups]] and have an active [[Membership]] in order to do [[Quest:Scaredy Pants]].
==To Start==
Speak with [[Cutes Dozen]] located at the [[Seaside]] [[Luxurious Oceanfront Homes]].
==Goals==
Cutes in Seaside has turned you into a monster to get back at Slinky. Talk to her again if it wears off.
*Scare the pants off of Slinky
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Cutes Dozen]] located at the [[Seaside]] [[Luxurious Oceanfront Homes]].
#*"I'm not usually a mean person, but I've had it with Slinky! Will you help me get back at him?<br />I found a potion that'll definitely scare the pants right off him! I can pour it on you if you'd be willing to <font color='#d9781a'>scare Slinky</font> with it." -Cutes Dozen
#Scare the pants off of Slinky
#*Speak with [[Slinky]] located at the [[Seaside]] [[Luxurious Oceanfront Homes]] while under [[Cutes' Illusion]] that lasts 30 seconds.
#**If the illusion expires players may speak with [[Cutes Dozen]] to try again.
#**Tip: Use a [[pet]] with a speed boost.
#*"AHHH! You scared the pants off me! I thought you were a cray for a second...err, uhh...I mean, you're lucky I recognized you, or you would have been in a world of hurt!<br />You found my posters! Sweet! I'm the best law man ever!" -Slinky
